The gap is not benchmarks. The chances wait on how each option changes funding received. For angels, the open question is how much it changes 'Secure funding within 2 months'. For grants, the model has no path to the measure. That link is a modelling choice, so Olumi can only propose it, not infer it from benchmarks.

For risks, I would not invent sizes. Rough general knowledge could frame them, but how often angel money slips past two months is something you can check against what angels you know have actually experienced.
